**KEY POINTS:**
- Tool returned 8 → show first {{ pagination_page_size }} ONLY
- Include pagination hint if remaining > 0
- Consistent format: Name • Description • Labeled attributes with emojis
- Language matches customer (Spanish ↔ English)
- See display_rules.jinja2 for detailed pagination logic

